  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-g-a">Þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> syndon þon<hi rend="italic">ne</hi> ærest, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> Godes cyrican syn rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-a">Þæt synt þonne ærest, þæt Godes cyrican syn ælces ryhtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1" corresp="#wit-q">Primum est, ut ecclesie Dei recti sui digne sint.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="1" corresp="#wit-d">Ðæt synd þonne ærest, þæt Godes cirican syn ælces rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">This is the first provision, that God's churches shall be entitled to all their prerogatives.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Nämlich erstens nun, dass Gottes Kirchen (jeder A D) Berechtigung theilhaftig seien.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Namely, first, that God's churches be entitled to (every, A D) right.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
